把你追回来
and win you back.

349
00:18:19,860 --> 00:18:22,140
我不在乎我的新娘是谁
I don't care who my new bride is.

350
00:18:26,220 --> 00:18:28,680
先声明 不能是我
Just upfront, it can't be me.

351
00:18:29,360 --> 00:18:31,760
因为众所周知 我已经把终生托付给工作了
'Cause everybody knows I'm married to my work.

352
00:18:35,380 --> 00:18:37,160
也不能是我
And it can't be me.

353
00:18:37,480 --> 00:18:38,820
反正就是不行
It just can't.

354
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:43,100
都不见得得是新娘 新郎也行嘛
They don't even have to be the best or even good.

355
00:18:43,580 --> 00:18:45,180
标准什么都是浮云
Standards are out the window.

356
00:18:49,540 --> 00:18:51,520
瞧 加州葡萄干的吉祥物来了
Look, it's a California Raisin.

357
00:18:56,069 --> 00:18:58,700
墨镜加止痛片
Sunglasses and Advil.

358
00:18:58,700 --> 00:19:00,240
昨晚的确超级疯狂啊
Last night was mad real.

359
00:19:01,840 --> 00:19:02,400
阿憨
Han,

360
00:19:03,020 --> 00:19:04,960
你愿意为了让我留在美国而跟我结婚吗
will you marry me so I can stay in the country?

361
00:19:06,600 --> 00:19:08,140
我得考虑考虑
I'll need to think about it.

362
00:19:08,140 --> 00:19:09,060
我愿意
Yes.

363
00:19:11,600 --> 00:19:14,560
显然他唯一不愿意的事是给我们上医保
Apparently the only thing he won't say yes to is health care.

364
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:18,700
奥列格 我不相信你
Oleg, I don't believe you.

365
00:19:19,200 --> 00:19:21,320
这不过又是你耍的小诡计
This is just another trick to get me to do

366
00:19:21,320 --> 00:19:22,780
骗我做你想我做的事
what you want me to do.

367
00:19:23,300 --> 00:19:26,780
就像上次你不断地把冰淇淋"掉"到你大腿间
Like when you kept "Dropping" your ice cream into your lap.

368
00:19:29,220 --> 00:19:30,040
没有诡计
No trick.

369
00:19:30,560 --> 00:19:33,920
有时爱会让你做出疯狂而恶心的事情
Sometimes love makes you do crazy, disgusting things.

370
00:19:34,140 --> 00:19:35,060
像这样
Like this.

371
00:19:35,640 --> 00:19:36,520
过来 阿憨
Come here, Han.

372
00:19:42,820 --> 00:19:45,300
现在我也爱上这份工作了
And now I love this job, too!

373
00:19:47,860 --> 00:19:49,600
还好他选的是阿憨
Thank God he picked Han.

374
00:19:52,980 --> 00:19:56,000
苏菲 奥列格一定非常爱你
Wow, Sophie. Oleg must really love you.

375
00:19:56,100 --> 00:19:57,880
这对他来说一定很难
That had to be hard for him.

376
00:19:58,240 --> 00:20:02,360
依我所见 对阿憨来说也有点小难[硬]
And from what I can see, a little hard for Han, too.

377
00:20:05,720 --> 00:20:08,120
在我们的婚礼上 口气清新剂得多喷一下
At our wedding, maybe two pumps of breath spray.

378
00:20:10,980 --> 00:20:13,360
阿憨 你不能跟奥列格结婚
Han, you're not marrying Oleg.

379
00:20:14,840 --> 00:20:17,080
因为奥列格要跟我结婚
'Cause Oleg's marrying me.

380
00:20:19,860 --> 00:20:22,020
我现在相信你了
I believe you now.

381
00:20:22,760 --> 00:20:24,060
因为你亲了阿憨
'Cause you kissed Han,

382
00:20:24,240 --> 00:20:26,780
而亚洲小妹根本不是你的菜
and Asian girls aren't even your thing.

383
00:20:34,880 --> 00:20:37,800
天啊 麦克 这是我的咪咪照
Oh my God, Max, it's my boob pic.

384
00:20:38,120 --> 00:20:40,120
有人把它做成一张网络火图
Someone made it into a meme.

385
00:20:42,080 --> 00:20:43,320
乳房X线照片的火图吗
A mammo meme?

386
00:20:45,160 --> 00:20:47,200
40岁以前按理不需要照这个的呀
You're not supposed to need those 'til you're 40.

387
00:20:48,960 --> 00:20:52,340
我下半辈子都要"夹"在我咪咪照下抬不起头
My boob pic is gonna be hanging over me for the rest of my life.

388
00:20:52,540 --> 00:20:53,520
得了吧
Oh, come on,

389
00:20:53,520 --> 00:20:55,200
你的咪咪连一根铅笔都"夹"不住
your boob couldn't hang over a pencil.
